{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Far away, on space colony Epsilon 13, Layla and her team were conducting interdimensional research. But when a portal tore open mid-experiment, the lab was flooded with hostile alien lifeforms. The systems failed. The lights went out. The facility fell silent.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the data disks containing years of research have scattered across the maze-like facility \u2014 and Layla is the only one left to retrieve them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll guide Layla through shifting corridors, dodging and outmaneuvering alien patrols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tribute to the &quot;dot-eaters&quot; and maze games of the classic 2600 console and early 8-bit home computers \u2014 simple controls, fast-paced gameplay, and a focus on score chasing.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic  maze action inspired by early home systems</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical bonus round after each wave for big points</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three lives to start \u2014 earn extras every 5 waves</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect disks, avoid enemies, and rack up a high score\u00a0</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925540?t=1759859991","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925540/aff1120c24cf56c15f0a120c36aa07630c3e054f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759859991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925540/3353826ed67eef2b9a27e39bd9717096c47b4aa1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759859991","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925540/3353826ed